<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drones struck near Khartoum, killing four people and damaging a United Nations building, while another drone attack hit a residential area and a second UN facility in the capital. RSF ground forces attacked aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties, and charity kitchens in Khartoum are closing, leaving displaced Sudanese, especially the elderly, in severe hardship. Sudanese doctors are urging aid agencies to rehabilitate a looted hospital in West Kordofan, and the Sennar state has resumed banana exports to Saudi Arabia after a multi-year halt. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNc2c5YVR5ejB2ZlN3RC1wNXVoSUtmc3hsems4MnJDN0pZeWpXaGhEcl96QTVCb3pzNlpoaGhxZVh0OHg2UUw5cnFkSHh2MGpxNklzTGtCZE5Cd2FvUnFJT1ctVTdOZjhOMG9JQ2JkdDRIdkNpR05WQjdUMmRQUVowdmFqaWdFdVdSbENkWUI4ZURmMFpXVEFTbFVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOU25rUmxhTDVOeWkyRTRDSEUtT0laYjZaQ2lfT0ZTT2Znd1BqS0Y4aDJkTWxXTVVyQWVQYW9kQVlkVDhxQlVlUGYwcks3UWFWVkVSOHhWZDltRjI1bEctSGwzaHNERjB6M2tVSDdpNWI2QnhTV1E5Z1FYeFIyNGhHVk9WSWUxMllSMnJ3cThmaTNDUGdRNnhGakdNdjZFc2dNc3p4MC1rUXZQSThUWGEzM3RRVXVlYWwyZjYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;defensearabia.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5GdzVFTHNrb2VLZ3o2MDVCbHJoM0xZTWRsaWlBLVQ3SzJmZmNRSmdHUDRoZEFIZzcweUNud1BqenBiMjdrMl80SWsxTTRLY3l2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOTWhOcW4wQmJvRWl1c2hON